[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 123.",
    "start": 1.55,
    "end": 4.962,
    "zh": "第123课。",
    "zh_hant": "第123課。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "A trip to Australia.",
    "start": 5.012,
    "end": 6.893,
    "zh": "去澳大利亚旅行。",
    "zh_hant": "去澳大利亞旅行。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 8.013,
    "end": 11.495,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Who is the man with the beard?",
    "start": 13.576,
    "end": 16.137,
    "zh": "那个留胡子的男人是谁？",
    "zh_hant": "那個留鬍子的男人是誰？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Look, Scott.",
    "start": 18.479,
    "end": 19.519,
    "zh": "看，斯科特。",
    "zh_hant": "看，斯科特。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "This is a photograph I took during my trip to Australia.",
    "start": 19.739,
    "end": 23.461,
    "zh": "这是我去澳大利亚旅行时拍的一张照片。",
    "zh_hant": "這是我去澳大利亞旅行時拍的一張照片。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Let me see it, Mike.",
    "start": 24.682,
    "end": 26.362,
    "zh": "让我看看，迈克。",
    "zh_hant": "讓我看看，邁克。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "This is a good photograph.",
    "start": 27.343,
    "end": 29.304,
    "zh": "这张照片拍得很好。",
    "zh_hant": "這張照片拍得很好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Who are these people?",
    "start": 29.384,
    "end": 30.945,
    "zh": "这些人是谁？",
    "zh_hant": "這些人是誰？"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "They're people I met during the trip.",
    "start": 32.246,
    "end": 34.567,
    "zh": "他们是我旅行时遇到的人。",
    "zh_hant": "他們是我旅行時遇到的人。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "That's the ship we travelled on.",
    "start": 35.767,
    "end": 37.928,
    "zh": "那是我们乘坐的船。",
    "zh_hant": "那是我們乘坐的船。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "What a beautiful ship!",
    "start": 39.529,
    "end": 41.29,
    "zh": "多漂亮的船啊！",
    "zh_hant": "多漂亮的船啊！"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Who's this?",
    "start": 42.491,
    "end": 43.711,
    "zh": "这是谁？",
    "zh_hant": "這是誰？"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "That's the man I told you about.",
    "start": 44.432,
    "end": 46.433,
    "zh": "那是我跟你提起过的那个人。",
    "zh_hant": "那是我跟你提起過的那個人。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Remember?",
    "start": 46.313,
    "end": 47.193,
    "zh": "记得吗？",
    "zh_hant": "記得嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Ah yes.",
    "start": 48.094,
    "end": 49.475,
    "zh": "啊，是的。",
    "zh_hant": "啊，是的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "The one who offered you a job in Australia.",
    "start": 49.535,
    "end": 52.336,
    "zh": "就是在澳大利亚给你工作机会的那个人。",
    "zh_hant": "就是在澳大利亞給你工作機會的那個人。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "That's right.",
    "start": 52.957,
    "end": 54.077,
    "zh": "没错。",
    "zh_hant": "沒錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Who's this?",
    "start": 55.198,
    "end": 56.359,
    "zh": "这是谁？",
    "zh_hant": "這是誰？"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Guess!",
    "start": 57.28,
    "end": 58.1,
    "zh": "猜猜！",
    "zh_hant": "猜猜！"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "It's not you, is it?",
    "start": 59.221,
    "end": 60.922,
    "zh": "这不是你，对吧？",
    "zh_hant": "這不是你，對吧？"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "That's right.",
    "start": 61.502,
    "end": 62.623,
    "zh": "没错。",
    "zh_hant": "沒錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "I grew a beard during the trip,",
    "start": 62.903,
    "end": 64.964,
    "zh": "旅行期间我留了胡子，",
    "zh_hant": "旅行期間我留了鬍子，"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "but I shaved it off when I came home.",
    "start": 65.065,
    "end": 67.966,
    "zh": "但回家后我把它剃掉了。",
    "zh_hant": "但回家後我把它剃掉了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "Why did you shave it off?",
    "start": 69.027,
    "end": 70.768,
    "zh": "你为什么把它剃掉？",
    "zh_hant": "你為什麼把它剃掉？"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "My wife didn't like it!",
    "start": 71.809,
    "end": 73.83,
    "zh": "我妻子不喜欢！",
    "zh_hant": "我妻子不喜歡！"
  }
]
